Error: --route-file is required.
usage: addStopDelay.py [-h] [-c FILE] [-C FILE] [--save-template FILE]
                       [-r ROUTEFILE] [-o OUT] [-s SEED] [-p PROBABILITY]
                       [--min MIN] [--max MAX] [--mean MEAN] [--dev DEV]

Sample routes to match counts

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -c FILE, --configuration-file FILE
                        read configuration from FILE
  -C FILE, --save-configuration FILE
                        save configuration to FILE and exit
  --save-template FILE  save configuration template to FILE and exit
  -r ROUTEFILE, --route-file ROUTEFILE
                        Input route file
  -o OUT, --output-file OUT
                        Output route file
  -s SEED, --seed SEED  random seed
  -p PROBABILITY, --probability PROBABILITY
                        apply delay with the given probability ]0, 1]
  --min MIN             minimum delay value (default 0)
  --max MAX             maximum delay value (default 3600)
  --mean MEAN           mean delay (default 0)
  --dev DEV             mean standard deviation of delay (default 60)
